      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1896-10-10_WidnesExaminer_art0011" n="art0011">
        <head>IeXAMINER, itll}llll-)AY 00T013ER 10. 196 THE SUNDERED HEARTS;</head>
        <p>THE IeXAMINER, itll}llll-)AY 00T013ER 10. 196 THE SUNDERED HEARTS;</p>
        <p>St=mims,</p>
        <p>MADP--UP DISHES</p>
